abstract: >-
  Offline network-forensics and Android package examination for police
  cybercrime units. Every verdict is tied to measured benign base rates and a
  cited source, and every result states what was not examined. Built for
  KANAD S.H.I.E.L.D. 2026 (Ahmedabad City Police).
